Z||000000||Fformula88||03-04-2001||11:42 AM||||Watkins Glen will be allowing people to take a few laps around the Glen again this year!  A couple people here went last year so I figured a few people may be interested.  Here's the info.  I'm planning on getting my Formula out there for a few laps!<P>Sunday May 6... for $10 you will be able to drive 3 laps during "controlled pace laps".  It may not be racing but for $10 its got to be fun!!  <P>here is the web address for anyone looking for more info.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.theglen.com/events.asp" TARGET=_blank>www.theglen.com/events.asp</A> <P>------------------<BR>John<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">      <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2m6<BR>1987 Fiero Sport Coupe *In rebuilding*<BR>1997 Ford Probe SE<BR>AOL IM: Fformula88||||reg||1
